"Dit is en tuuschbor Spiekermedium, dat över sien Beteker (\"%1\") kennt "
"warrt."

#: libs/database/collectionmanager.cpp:783
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This entry will only be identified by the path where it is found on your "
"system (\"%1\"). No more specific means of identification (UUID, label) is "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Disse Indrag warrt bloots över sien Padd op Dien Systeem (\"%1\") kennt. Dat "
"gifft keen anner, nauer Kennen (UUID, Beteker)."

#: libs/database/collectionmanager.cpp:794
msgid ""
"It is not possible on your system to identify the storage media of this "
"path. It will be added using the file path as the only identifier. This will "
"work well for your local hard disk."
msgstr ""
"Op Dien Systeem lett sik dat Spiekermedium vun dissen Padd nich kennen. Dat "
