#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:73
msgid ""
"<b>First-run Wizard: Configure where images and meta-data are stored</b>"
msgstr "<b>Inricht-Hölper: De Steden för Biller un Metadaten fastleggen</b>"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:94
msgctxt ""
"This is a path name so you should include the slash in the translation"
msgid "/Pictures"
msgstr "/Biller"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:99
msgid ""
"<p>Please enter a location where you want to store your images.</p> <p>You "
"can choose any local folder, even one that already contains images.<br/> "
"More folders can be added later under the <i>Settings</i> menu. </p> "
"<p><i>Note:</i> Removable media (like USB drives) and shared file systems "
"(both NFS or Samba) are supported.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Giff bitte de Steed in, woneem Du Dien Biller wohren wullt.</p> <p>Du "
"kannst jichtenseen lokaal Orner utsöken, un ok een, binnen den Du al Biller "
"hest.<br/> Du kannst later noch binnen dat <i>Instellen</i>-Menü anner "
"Ornern tofögen.</p> <p><i>Beacht:</i> Tuuschbor Medien (as USB-Loopwarken) "
"un deelt Dateisystemen (a.B. NFS un Samba) warrt ok ünnerstütt.</p>"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:112
msgid ""
"<p>digiKam stores information and meta-data about your images in a database "
"file. Please set the location of this file or accept the default.</"
"p><p><i>Note:</i> You need to have write access to the folder used here, and "
"you cannot use a remote location on a networked server, using NFS or Samba.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>DigiKam wohrt Informatschonen un Metadaten över Dien Biller binnen en "
"Datrenbankdatei. Legg bitte de Steed för disse Datei fast, oder beglööv de "
"Standardinstellen.</p><p><i>Beacht:</i> Du bruukst Schriefverlöven för den "
"dissen Orner, un Du kannst keen feern Steed op en anner - mit NFS oder Samba "
"tokoppelt - Server in't Nettwark bruken.</p>"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:165
msgid ""
"You must select a folder for digiKam to use as the root album. All of your "
"images will go there."
msgstr ""
"Du muttst en Orner utsöken, den digiKam as Wörtelalbum bruken schall. All "
"Dien Biller kaamt dor rin."

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:179
msgid ""
"digiKam will not use your home folder as the root album. Please select "
"another location."
msgstr ""
"DigiKam kann Dien Tohuusorner nich as Wörtelalbum bruken. Söök bitte en "
"anner Steed ut."

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The folder to use as the root album path does not exist: <p><b>%1</b></"
"p>Would you like digiKam to create it for you?"
msgstr ""
"Den Orner, den digiKam as Wörtelalbum bruken schall, gifft dat nich: <p><b>%"
"1</b></p>Schall digiKam em nu för Di opstellen?"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:193
msgid "Create Root Album Folder?"
msgstr "Wörtelalbum-Orner opstellen?"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:203
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"digiKam could not create the folder to use as the root album.\n"
"Please select a different location.<p><b>%1</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"DigiKam kann den Wörtelalbum-Orner nich opstellen.\n"
"Söök bitte en anner Steed ut.<p><b>%1</b></p>"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:206
msgid "Create Root Album Folder Failed"
msgstr "Opstellen vun den Wörtelalbum-Orner fehlslaan"

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:215
msgid ""
"You don't seem to have write access for the folder selected to be the root "
"album.\n"
"Warning: Without write access, the comment and tag features will not work."
msgstr ""
"As't lett hest Du keen Schriefverlöven för den utsöchten Wörtelalbum-Orner.\n"
"Wohrschoen: De Kommentar- un Slötelwoortfunkschonen laat sik ahn de "
"Schriefverlöven nich bruken."

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:229
msgid ""
"You must select a folder for digiKam to store information and meta-data in a "
"database file."
msgstr ""
"Du muttst en Orner utsöken, binnen den digiKam sien Datenbankdatei mit "
"Informatschonen un Metadaten wohren schall."

#: digikam/digikamfirstrun.cpp:255
#, kde-format
