#: digikam/albummanager.cpp:482
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your locale has changed since this album was last opened.\n"
"Old Locale : %1, New Locale : %2\n"
"If you changed your locale lately, this is all right.\n"
"Please notice that if you switched to a locale that does not support some of "
"the file names in your collection, these files may no longer be found in the "
"collection. If you are sure that you want to continue, click 'Yes'. "
"Otherwise, click 'No' and correct your locale setting before restarting "
"digiKam."
msgstr ""
"Dien Regiooninstellen hett sik na't verleden Opmaken vun dit Album ännert.\n"
"Ole Regioon: %1, niege Regioon: %2\n"
"Wenn Du Dien Regiooninstellen annerlest ännert hest, hett allens sien "
"Schick.\n"
"Beacht bitte: Wenn dat binnen Dien Sammeln Dateinaams gifft, de sik mit de "
"niege Regiooninstellen nich schrieven laat, dukt disse Dateien nich mehr "
"binnen de Sammeln op. Wenn Du seker büst, Du wullt so wiedermaken, klick op "
"\"Jo\". Wenn nich, denn klick op \"Nee\" un richt Dien Regiooninstellen, ehr "
"Du digiKam nochmaal opröppst."

