#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/klensfun.cpp:128
msgid "Use Metadata"
msgstr "Metadaten bruken"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/klensfun.cpp:141
msgid "Lens:"
msgstr "Lins:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/klensfun.cpp:145
msgid ""
"Set this option to try to guess the right camera/lens settings from the "
"image metadata (as Exif or XMP)."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du de richtigen Instellen för de Kamera/Lins ut de Bild-"
"Metadaten (a.B. Exif oder Xmp) raden wullt."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/klensfun.cpp:151
msgid "Focal Length:"
msgstr "Brennwiet:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/klensfun.cpp:153
msgid "Subject Distance:"
msgstr "Objekt-Afstand:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:70
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:295
msgid "Lens Auto-Correction"
msgstr "Lins automaatsch richten"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:90
msgid "Show grid"
msgstr "Gadder wiesen"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:91
msgid "Set this option to visualize correction grid to be applied."
msgstr "Maak dit an, wenn Du en Korrektuurgadder tofögen wullt."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:93
msgid "Chromatic Aberration"
msgstr "Klöörafwieken"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:94
msgid ""
"Chromatic aberration is easily recognized as color fringes towards the image "
"corners. CA is due to a varying lens focus for different colors."
msgstr ""
"Klöörafwieken lett sik eenfach kennen, dat gifft Klöörränners na't Bild sien "
"Huken hen. De Lins hett denn verscheden Brennwieden för de Klören."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:97
msgid "Vignetting"
msgstr "Randschadden"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:98
msgid ""
"Vignetting refers to an image darkening, mostly in the corners. Optical and "
"natural vignetting can be canceled out with this option, whereas mechanical "
"vignetting will not be cured."
msgstr ""
"Randschadden bedüüdt, dat Bild warrt tomehrst na de Huken hen düüsterer. "
"Optisch un natüürlich Randschaddens laat sik mit disse Funkschoon wegmaken, "
"mechaansche nich."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:101
msgid "Color Correction"
msgstr "Klöörrichten"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:102
msgid ""
"All lenses have a slight color tinge to them, mostly due to the anti-"
"reflective coating. The tinge can be canceled when the respective data is "
"known for the lens."
msgstr ""
"All Linsen hebbt en Klöörfehler, in de Hööftsaak kummt dat vun de Antireflex-"
"Laag. Disse Fehler lett sik richten, wenn Du de tohören Daten vun de Lins "
"kennen deist."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:105
msgid "Distortion"
msgstr "Vertarren"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:106
msgid ""
"Distortion refers to an image deformation, which is most pronounced towards "
"the corners. These Seidel aberrations are known as pincushion and barrel "
"distortions."
msgstr ""
"Vertarren is en leeg Weddergaav vun de Formen op't Bild un warrt na de Huken "
"hen stärker. Disse Afbildfehlers sünd as »Küssen-« un »Tünnvertarren« begäng."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:109
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "Geometrie"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/autocorrection/autocorrectiontool.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Four geometries are handled here: Rectilinear (99 percent of all lenses), "
"Fisheye, Cylindrical, Equirectangular."
msgstr ""
"Hier sünd veer Buuformen mööglich: Liekut (99% Perzent vun all Linsen), "
"Fischoog, Zylinnersch un Längdenliek Zylinnersch."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:77
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:320
msgid "Lens Distortion"
msgstr "Linsvertarren"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:96
msgid ""
"You can see here a thumbnail preview of the distortion correction applied to "
"a cross pattern."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Lüttbild-Vöransicht vun de Vertarren-Korrektuur, anwendt op en "
"Gadder."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:101
#: imageplugins/whitebalance/whitebalancetool.cpp:224
msgid "Main:"
msgstr "Allgemeen:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:107
msgid ""
"This value controls the amount of distortion. Negative values correct lens "
"barrel distortion, while positive values correct lens pincushion distortion."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert stüert de Vertarrenstärk. Negative Weerten richt Tünn-Vertarren, "
"un positive Weerten Küssen-Vertarren."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:113
msgid "Edge:"
msgstr "Kant:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:119
msgid ""
"This value controls in the same manner as the Main control, but has more "
"effect at the edges of the image than at the center."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert stüert dat sülve Bedregen as de allgemeen Kuntrull, man hett "
"mehr Effekt op de Bildkanten as op de Merrn."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:124
msgid "Zoom:"
msgstr "Ansichtgrött:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:130
msgid "This value rescales the overall image size."
msgstr "Disse Weert passt de Bildgrött nieg to."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:134
msgid "Brighten:"
msgstr "Ophellen:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/distortion/lensdistortiontool.cpp:140
msgid "This value adjusts the brightness in image corners."
msgstr "Disse Weert passt de Helligkeit in de Bildecken to."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:77
#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:370
msgid "Vignetting Correction"
msgstr "Randschadden richten"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:96
msgid ""
"You can see here a thumbnail preview of the anti-vignetting mask applied to "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en Lüttbild-Vöransicht vun de Mask för't Randschadden-Minnern, de op "
"dat Bild anwendt warrt."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:101
msgid "Density:"
msgstr "Dichte:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:107
msgid ""
"This value controls the degree of intensity attenuation by the filter at its "
"point of maximum density."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert stüert den Graad vun Helligkeitminnern dör den Filter, meten op "
"em sien Punkt mit de hööchste Dicht."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:112
msgid "Power:"
msgstr "Övergang:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:118
msgid ""
"This value is used as the exponent controlling the fall-off in density from "
"the center of the filter to the periphery."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert warrt as Exponent för dat Afnehmen vun de Filterdicht vun de "
"Merrn na buten bruukt."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:123
#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:98
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/sharpnesseditor/sharpentool.cpp:140
msgid "Radius:"
msgstr "Halfmaat:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:129
msgid ""
"This value is the radius of the center filter. It is a multiple of the half-"
"diagonal measure of the image, at which the density of the filter falls to "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Disse Weert stüert dat Halfmaat vun de Filterschiev. He warrt mit dat halve "
"Diagonaalmaat vun dat Bild maalnahmen, bi \"1\" fallt de Filterdicht also "
"jüst in de Bildeck op Null af."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:137
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bcgtool.cpp:108
#: utilities/imageeditor/rawimport/rawsettingsbox.cpp:188
msgid "Brightness:"
msgstr "Helligkeit:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:143
msgid "Set here the brightness re-adjustment of the target image."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du de Helligkeit vun't Teelbild topassen."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:147
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bcgtool.cpp:115
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/iccprooftool.cpp:411
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:411
#: utilities/imageeditor/rawimport/rawsettingsbox.cpp:195
msgid "Contrast:"
msgstr "Kontrast:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:153
msgid "Set here the contrast re-adjustment of the target image."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du den Kontrast vun't Teelbild topassen."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:157
#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:232
#: imageplugins/whitebalance/whitebalancetool.cpp:201
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bcgtool.cpp:122
#: utilities/imageeditor/rawimport/rawsettingsbox.cpp:202
msgid "Gamma:"
msgstr "Gamma:"

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/vignetting/antivignettingtool.cpp:163
msgid "Set here the gamma re-adjustment of the target image."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du den Gammaweert vun't Teelbild topassen."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/imageplugin_lenscorrection.cpp:60
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/imageplugin_core.cpp:106
msgid "Auto-Correction..."
msgstr "Automaatsch Korrektuur..."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/imageplugin_lenscorrection.cpp:68
msgid "Distortion..."
msgstr "Vertarren..."

#: imageplugins/lenscorrection/imageplugin_lenscorrection.cpp:74
msgid "Vignetting Correction..."
msgstr "Randschadden richten..."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/imageplugin_noisereduction.cpp:51
msgid "Noise Reduction..."
msgstr "Ruusminnern..."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:77
#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:457
msgid "Noise Reduction"
msgstr "Ruusminnern"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:96
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Enkelheiten"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:104
msgid ""
"<b>Radius</b>: this control selects the gliding window size used for the "
"filter. Larger values do not increase the amount of time needed to filter "
"each pixel in the image but can cause blurring. This window moves across the "
"image, and the color in it is smoothed to remove imperfections. In any case "
"it must be about the same size as the noise granularity or somewhat more. If "
"it is set higher than necessary, then it can cause unwanted blur."
msgstr ""
"<b>Halfmaat</b>: Leggt de Grött vun den glieden Filterutsnitt fast. Bi höger "
"Weerten bruukt de Filter nich länger, man dat Bild warrt verwischt. De "
"Utsnitt beweegt sik över dat Bild, wielt de Klöörverscheel dor binnen weker "
"maakt warrt. He schull so groot wesen as de Ruusplackens, oder en lütt beten "
"grötter. Is he grötter as wat noot deit, verwischt dat Bild."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:115
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/sharpnesseditor/sharpentool.cpp:156
msgid "Threshold:"
msgstr "Grenzweert:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:121
msgid ""
"<b>Threshold</b>: use the slider for coarse adjustment, and the spin control "
"for fine adjustment to control edge detection sensitivity. This value should "
"be set so that edges and details are clearly visible and noise is smoothed "
"out. Adjustment must be made carefully, because the gap between \"noisy\", "
"\"smooth\", and \"blur\" is very small. Adjust it as carefully as you would "
"adjust the focus of a camera."
msgstr ""
"<b>Grenzweert</b>: Mit den Schuver kannst Du den Weert groff un mit dat "
"Dreihfeld nau instellen. He stüert de Föhlsamkeit bi't Kantenopdecken un "
"schull so sett warrn, dat Kanten un Enkelheiten kloor sichtbor blievt un "
"Rusen utfiltert warrt. Pass den Weert achtsom to, \"plackig\", \"week\" un "
"\"verwischt\" liggt dicht bienanner. Pass em so achtsom to as Du ok en "
"Kamera scharp stellst."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:131
msgid "Texture:"
msgstr "Textuur:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:137
msgid ""
"<b>Texture</b>: this control sets the texture accuracy. This value can be "
"used, to get more or less texture accuracy. When decreased, then noise and "
"texture are blurred out, when increased then texture is amplified, but also "
"noise will increase. It has almost no effect on image edges."
msgstr ""
"<b>Textuur</b>: Sett de Textuur-Akraatheit. Settst Du dissen Weert daal, "
"warrt Ruusplackens un de Textuur verwischt, settst Du em rop, warrt de "
"Textuur rutheevt, man ok de Plackens. De Filter hett meist keen Effekt op "
"Kanten."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:144
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/sharpnesseditor/sharpentool.cpp:118
msgid "Sharpness:"
msgstr "Scharpde:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:150
msgid ""
"<b>Sharpness</b>: This value improves the frequency response for the filter. "
"When it is too strong then not all noise can be removed, or spike noise may "
"appear. Set it near to maximum, if you want to remove very weak noise or "
"JPEG-artifacts, without losing detail."
msgstr ""
"<b>Scharpde</b>: Disse Weert verbetert de Frequenzantwoort vun den Filter. "
"Is se to groot, lett sik nich all Rusen wegmaken oder Prickelrusen dukt op. "
"Sett den Weert in de Neegde vun den Hööchstweert, wenn Du swach Rusen oder "
"JPEG-Fehlers richten wullt, ahn dat Enkelheiten wegkaamt."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:158
msgid "Edge Lookahead:"
msgstr "Kant-Vörutkieken:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:164
msgid ""
"<b>Edge</b>: This value defines the pixel distance to which the filter looks "
"ahead for edges. When this value is increased, then spike noise is erased. "
"You can eventually re-adjust the <b>Edge</b> filter, when you have changed "
"this setting. When this value is too high, the adaptive filter can no longer "
"accurately track image details, and noise or blurring can occur."
msgstr ""
"<b>Kant</b>: Disse Weert gifft den Pixelafstand an, binnen den de Filter na "
"Kanten vörutkiekt. Is disse Weert höger, warrt Prickelrusen utfiltert. Du "
"kannst den <b>Kant</b>-Filter oplest nieg topassen, wenn Du disse Instellen "
"ännert hest. Is de Weert to groot, kann de Filter de Bildenkelheiten nich "
"mehr richtig opspören - dat Rusen dukt wedder op un dat Bild verwischt."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:173
msgid "Erosion:"
msgstr "Afdregen:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:179
msgid ""
"<b>Erosion</b>: Use this to increase edge noise erosion and spike noise "
"erosion (noise is removed by erosion)."
msgstr ""
"<b>Afdregen</b>: Över disse Instellen kannst Du dat Afdregen vun Kant- un "
"Prickelrusen verbetern (de Plackens warrt afdragen)."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:202
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Verwiedert"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:204
msgid "Luminance:"
msgstr "Bildhelligkeit:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:210
msgid ""
"<b>Luminance</b>: this control sets the luminance tolerance of the image.We "
"recommend using either the <b>Color</b> or the <b>Luminance</b> tolerance "
"settings to make an image correction, not both at the same time. These "
"settings do not influence the main smoothing process controlled by the "
"<b>Details</b> settings."
msgstr ""
"<b>Bildhelligkeit</b>: Sett den Weert för de tolaten Bildhelligkeit. Dat is "
"anraadt, bloots een vun de Weerten för tolaten <b>Klöör</b> oder "
"<b>Bildhelligkeit</b> bi de Bildkorrektuur to bruken, nich all twee tosamen. "
"Disse Instellen warkt sik nich op den Hööft-Weekmaakperzess ut, de sik ünner "
"<b>Enkelheiten</b> stüern lett."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:218
#: imageplugins/inserttext/inserttexttool.cpp:170
msgid "Color:"
msgstr "Klöör:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:224
msgid ""
"<b>Color</b>: this control sets the color tolerance of the image. It is "
"recommended using either the <b>Color</b> or the <b>Luminance</b> tolerance "
"to make image correction, not both at the same time. These settings do not "
"influence the main smoothing process controlled by the <b>Details</b> "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"<b>Klöör</b>: Sett den Weert för de tolaten Klöör. Dat is anraadt, bloots "
"een vun de Weerten för tolaten <b>Klöör</b> oder <b>Bildhelligkeit</b> bi de "
"Bildkorrektuur to bruken, nich all twee tosamen. Disse Instellen warkt sik "
"nich op den Hööft-Weekmaakperzess ut, de sik ünner <b>Enkelheiten</b> stüern "
"lett."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:238
msgid ""
"<b>Gamma</b>: this control sets the gamma tolerance of the image. This value "
"can be used to increase the tolerance values for darker areas (which "
"commonly are noisier). This results in more blur for shadow areas."
msgstr ""
"<b>Gamma</b>: Sett den Weert för den tolaten Gammaweert. Mit dissen Weert "
"kannst Du mehr Weerten för düüster Rebeden tolaten (de normalerwies ok wat "
"mehr Rusen bargt). Dat Resultaat is en stärker Verwischen binnen "
"Schaddenrebeden."

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:244
msgid "Damping:"
msgstr "Dämpen:"

#: imageplugins/noisereduction/noisereductiontool.cpp:250
msgid ""
"<b>Damping</b>: this control sets the phase-jitter damping adjustment. This "
"value defines how fast the adaptive filter-radius reacts to luminance "
"variations. If increased, then edges appear smoother; if too high, then blur "
"may occur. If at minimum, then noise and phase jitter at the edges can "
"occur. It can suppress spike noise when increased, and this is the preferred "
"method to remove it."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dämpen</b>: Sett de Dämpen för't Faasjiddeln, de fastleggt, wo gau sik "
"dat Filterhalfmaat op Ännern vun de Bildhelligkeit topasst. Wenn grötter "
"maakt, seht Kanten weker ut, wenn to groot, verwischt dat Bild. Mit den "
"lüttsten Weert kann an de Kanten Faasjiddeln un Rusen opduken. De Filter "
"kann Prickelrusen utfiltern, dat is dor ok de vörtrocken Metood för."

