msgstr "Hier kannst Du de Helligkeit vun't Bild topassen."

#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bcgtool.cpp:120
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/iccprooftool.cpp:415
#: imageplugins/coreplugin/bwsepiatool.cpp:415
