"Turn on this option to store image captions in the JFIF Comment section, the "
"EXIF tag, the XMP tag, and the IPTC tag."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Bildtiteln na den JFIF-Afsnitt, na't EXIF-, dat XMP- un "
"dat IPTC-Feld sekern wullt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:141
msgid "&Save image timestamps as tags"
msgstr "Bild-Tietmarken binnen Feller &sekern"

