"Turn on this option to store the image rating in the EXIF tag and the XMP "
"tags."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Dien Beweerten na de EXIF- un XMP-Feller sekern wullt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:151
msgid "&Write Metadata to RAW files (experimental)"
msgstr "Metadaten na Rohdateien &schrieven (warrt utprobeert)"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:152
msgid ""
"Turn on this option to write metadata into RAW TIFF/EP files based. This "
"feature require Exiv2 shared library version >= 0.18.0. It still "
"experimental, and disabled by default."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du Metadaten na TIFF-/EP-Rohdateien schrieven wullt. Dit "
"bruukt Verschoon >= 0.18.0 vun de deelte Exiv2-Bibliotheek. Dit warrt noch "
"utprobeert un is standardwies utmaakt."

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:177
msgid "Visit Exiv2 project website"
msgstr "Na Exiv2-Projektnettsiet gahn"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:182
msgid ""
"<p><b><a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exif'>EXIF</a></b> - a standard "
"used by most digital cameras today to store technical information (like "
"aperture and shutter speed) about an image.</p><p><b><a href='http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/IPTC'>IPTC</a></b> - an older standard used in digital "
"photography to store photographer information in an image.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><a href='http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exif'>EXIF</a></b> is en "
"Standard, den de mehrsten modern Kameras bruukt, wenn se technische "
"Informatschonen över dat Bild sekert.</p><p><b><a href='http://de.wikipedia."
"org/wiki/IPTC-NAA-Standard'>IPTC</a></b> is en anner Standard för de "
"Digitaalfotografie, mit den sik Informatschonen na Biller inbetten laat.</p>"

#: utilities/setup/setupmetadata.cpp:190
msgid ""
"<p><b><a href='http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Extensible_Metadata_Platform'>XMP</a></b> - a new standard used in digital "
"photography dedicated to replace IPTC.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b><a href='http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Extensible_Metadata_Platform'>XMP</a></b> is en nieg Standard in de "
"Digitaalfotografie. He schall maal IPTC utwesseln.</p>"

